cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OmicsVisor in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "OmicsVisor: an interactive Shiny application for exploring differential omics results"
abstract: >-
  OmicsVisor is a modular R Shiny application for interactive exploration and
  visualisation of differential omics analysis results (proteomics,
  transcriptomics and related data types). It provides volcano, donut, UpSet,
  heatmap, PCA/UMAP, boxplot, correlation and scatter views over a single
  ID-keyed results table, plus GCT export and 1D enrichment analysis.
type: software
